149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (It is often difficult to quantify exactly how much value specific physical features \(like square footage, overall condition, or a pool\) add to a property, and how non-linear factors like neighborhood or zoning impact the final valuation. We needed a data-driven way to minimize these valuation errors.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
